# A weapon added by its data and nothing else: the assault rifle, fifteen
# rounds a second at ten damage a round, held for a second on a target three
# units away. Each round that hits is the engine's own (its spread puts some
# on other parts of the body); the shield takes its seven and a half, the body
# the rest.
scenario rifle_burst
map bloodgulch
start flat_field 77.9 -166.2 0.32 0.0
target 81.0 -166.2 0.32 3.14159265
weapon weapons/assault rifle/assault rifle
ticks 200
input 0 200 pitch=-0.13
input 60 90 fire=1

tolerance position 0
tolerance velocity 0
tolerance facing 0
tolerance state 0
tolerance rounds 0
tolerance heat 0
tolerance shield 0
tolerance body 0
tolerance stun 0
tolerance life 0
tolerance hit 0
